passed to the L<App::Sqitch::Plan::Change> constructor. Exits with a fatal
error if the change already exists, or if the any of the dependencies are
unknown.

=head3 C<rework>

  $plan->rework( 'whatevs' );
  $plan->rework( 'widgets', [qw(foo bar)], [qw(dr_evil)] );

