=head3 C<sqitch>

  my $sqitch = $plan->sqitch;

Returns the L<App::Sqitch> object that instantiated the plan.

=head3 C<target>

  my $target = $plan->target

Returns the L<App::Sqitch::Target> passed to the constructor.

=head3 C<file>

